## Direction Status

Use only `implemented`, `evidence-blocked`, or `deferred`. Include a test,
artifact, or precise blocker for every requested direction. An
`evidence-blocked` entry must show the attempted engine mapping and name the
exact required operation missing from the generic resource extension
interfaces. A missing reference model, implementation effort, or loss of a
preferred optimization is not a blocker. Never use model-owned resource
lifecycle as a fallback for a blocked direction.

